    "detailed_description": "Termalloc is a top-down 3D shooting game. You can move forward/backward and left/right, but you can not jump.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThere are 22 pentagon-pillar-like terminals in the field, and your mission is connect all of them to the server.<br />\r\nWhile connecting, terminals turn yellow, and green if connection is complete.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGuards are coming to stop you. Shoot them to keep yourself safe.<br />\r\nGuards get faster every time, and more and more are coming.<br />\r\nGuards sometimes drop a coin which you can pick up and buy upgrades.",
